      <div id="welcome-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="welcome-tab" tabindex="0" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel cmp-tabs__tabpanel--active" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel"><div class="container responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="textCommon aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
	
	<div class="ta-inner-container call-out-box--white" style="margin-bottom: px;margin-top: px" data-ceddl-component-info='{&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;textCommon&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Text Common (v2)&#34;}'>
		<div class="text-common">
			
			<div class="paragraph-generic">
				<div class=" collapsed clearfix" data-enable-read-more="false">

                    <div style="margin:auto">
                        <div class="block-with-text ">
							<div class="external-margin">
								<!-- Using 'unsafe' to allow analytics added -->
								<p class='ta-article-text'><span class="ta-lead-paragraph">More than meets the eye, Australia's capital city of Canberra brings together history, art and ample opportunity to get outdoors.</span></p>
<h3 class='ta-article-subtitle ta-text-navy-blue'>Canberra at a glance: Top experiences</h3>
<ul class='ta-article-text'>
<li><b>Museums and galleries: </b>Browse sculpture parks, international exhibitions and Aboriginal artworks at Canberra's cultural institutions, including the National Gallery of Australia.&nbsp;</li>
<li><b>Historical sites: </b>Explore Parliament House and learn about Australia's political history.</li>
<li><b>Lake adventures:</b> Walk or cycle around <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;/content/australia/en_us/places/canberra-and-surrounds/lake-burley-griffin.html&quot;}' href="/en-us/places/canberra-and-surrounds/lake-burley-griffin.html" target="_self">Lake Burley Griffin</a>, or get out on the water on a paddleboard or picnic boat.&nbsp;</li>
<li><b>Cool-climate wineries:</b> Discover shiraz, riesling and more at nearly 40 wineries in the Canberra Wine District.</li>
<li><b>Hot air balloons:</b> Soar over Canberra and Lake Burley Griffin in a hot air balloon and enjoy views out to the mountains.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
							 </div>

								
							</div>
						</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>


</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
   
      
      
      <div id="getting-here-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="getting-here-tab" tabindex="0" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel"><div class="container responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="textCommon aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
	
	<div class="ta-inner-container call-out-box--white" style="margin-bottom: px;margin-top: px" data-ceddl-component-info='{&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;textCommon&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Text Common (v2)&#34;}'>
		<div class="text-common">
			
			<div class="paragraph-generic">
				<div class=" collapsed clearfix" data-enable-read-more="false">

                    <div style="margin:auto">
                        <div class="block-with-text ">
							<div class="external-margin">
								<!-- Using 'unsafe' to allow analytics added -->
								<p class='ta-article-text'>Canberra is just as easily reached by air as by car. Fly into Canberra Airport (CBR) on either an international flight or from any Australian state or territory.&nbsp;</p>
<ul class='ta-article-text'>
<li>Canberra Airport (CBR) is 7km (4.5mi) from the city and services both international and domestic flights</li>
<li>Hire cars, taxis, rideshares and a shuttle service are available at the airport for pre-purchase or hire upon arrival</li>
<li>Canberra is just a three-hour drive south of Sydney</li>
</ul>
<p class='ta-article-text'>After you’ve arrived in Canberra, you’ll find <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;/content/australia/en_us/places/canberra-and-surrounds/getting-around-canberra.html&quot;}' href="/en-us/places/canberra-and-surrounds/getting-around-canberra.html" target="_self">getting around </a>is easy due to its compact size. Walking and biking are great options to see what's on offer.&nbsp;</p>
							 </div>

								
							</div>
						</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>


</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
   
      
      
      <div id="when-to-visit-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="when-to-visit-tab" tabindex="0" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel"><div class="container responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="textCommon aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
	
	<div class="ta-inner-container call-out-box--white" style="margin-bottom: px;margin-top: px" data-ceddl-component-info='{&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;textCommon&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Text Common (v2)&#34;}'>
		<div class="text-common">
			
			<div class="paragraph-generic">
				<div class=" collapsed clearfix" data-enable-read-more="false">

                    <div style="margin:auto">
                        <div class="block-with-text ">
							<div class="external-margin">
								<!-- Using 'unsafe' to allow analytics added -->
								<p class='ta-article-text'>Canberra enjoys warm summers and crisp winters, however this city is considered a year-round destination. During autumn and spring the city is at its most vibrant with exciting festivals, colourful natural landscapes and mild <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;/content/australia/en_us/facts-and-planning/weather-in-australia/canberra-weather.html&quot;}' href="/en-us/facts-and-planning/weather-in-australia/canberra-weather.html" target="_self">weather</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<ul class='ta-article-text'>
<li><b>High season:</b> Spring and autumn (August to October and March to May)</li>
<li><b>Low season:</b> Winter (June to July)</li>
<li><b>Don’t miss:</b>&nbsp;<a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://enlightencanberra.com/&quot;}' href="https://enlightencanberra.com/">Enlighten Festival</a> (March)</li>
</ul>
							 </div>

								
							</div>
						</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>


</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
   
      
      
      <div id="accessibility-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accessibility-tab" tabindex="0" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel"><div class="container responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="textCommon aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
	
	<div class="ta-inner-container call-out-box--white" style="margin-bottom: px;margin-top: px" data-ceddl-component-info='{&#34;componentId&#34;:&#34;textCommon&#34;,&#34;componentName&#34;:&#34;Text Common (v2)&#34;}'>
		<div class="text-common">
			
			<div class="paragraph-generic">
				<div class=" collapsed clearfix" data-enable-read-more="false">

                    <div style="margin:auto">
                        <div class="block-with-text ">
							<div class="external-margin">
								<!-- Using 'unsafe' to allow analytics added -->
								<p class='ta-article-text'>Travellers will find plenty of accessible and <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://visitcanberra.com.au/articles/wheelchair-friendly-weekend-away-in-canberra&quot;}' href="https://visitcanberra.com.au/articles/wheelchair-friendly-weekend-away-in-canberra" target="_blank">wheelchair-friendly</a> options for accommodation and attractions in Canberra. </p>
<ul class='ta-article-text'>
<li><b>Arrival:</b> Canberra Airport provides <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.canberraairport.com.au/passenger-guide/help-services/special-assistance&quot;}' href="https://www.canberraairport.com.au/passenger-guide/help-services/special-assistance" target="_blank">assistance</a> for people with disabilities. Staff can help with security screening and ordering an accessible taxi.</li>
<li><b>Getting around:</b> Canberra’s <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://cmet.com.au/accessibility/&quot;}' href="https://cmet.com.au/accessibility/" target="_blank">light rail stations</a> have ramp access and designated waiting areas for passengers needing assistance, while the city’s <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.transport.act.gov.au/travel-options/bus/accessible-travel&quot;}' href="https://www.transport.act.gov.au/travel-options/bus/accessible-travel" target="_blank">buses</a> have ramps that can be lowered. <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;http://13wats.com.au/&quot;}' href="http://13wats.com.au/" target="_blank">Wheelchair Accessible Taxi Services</a> can also be booked online or over the phone. </li>
<li><b>Accessible experience highlights:</b> Travellers with limited mobility can ride the Flora Explorer mini-bus throughout the abundant <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.anbg.gov.au/gardens/&quot;}' href="https://www.anbg.gov.au/gardens/" target="_blank">National Botanic Gardens</a>. Don't miss the faces of famous Aussies at the <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.portrait.gov.au/&quot;}' href="https://www.portrait.gov.au/" target="_blank">National Portrait Gallery</a>.</li>
<li><b>Helpful resources: </b>The Canberra-based travel agency <a data-ceddl-trigger='click' data-ceddl-event-info='{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;linkClick&quot;,&quot;pageTitle&quot;:&quot;Travel&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;to&nbsp;Canberra,&nbsp;ACT&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tourism&nbsp;Australia&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;linkURL&quot;:&quot;https://getaboutable.com/capital-beauty-canberra-inclusive-and-accessible/&quot;}' href="https://getaboutable.com/capital-beauty-canberra-inclusive-and-accessible/" target="_blank">GetOutAble</a> specialises in accessible and inclusive travel.</li>
</ul>
							 </div>

								
							</div>
						</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>


</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
   
   
</div></div>

</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-12 col-xl-4 clearfix">
